# Database Rules

Use Supabase Postgres.

Important tables:
- profiles
- products
- inventory_movements
- orders
- order_items
- woo_connections
- sync_logs

Every stock change must create an inventory movement.

Never update product stock silently.

Inventory movement should include:
- product_id
- previous_quantity
- change_quantity
- new_quantity
- reason
- source
- user_id
- created_at

Products should store WooCommerce IDs when synced:
- woo_product_id
- woo_variation_id if needed
- sku
- name
- price
- stock_quantity
- manage_stock
- status
- image_url
- last_synced_at

Sync logs should store:
- type
- status
- message
- payload
- created_at